| **P90 / P95**    | 90–95% of requests are faster         | SLA/UX monitoring                       |
| **P99 / P99.9**  | Only 1% or 0.1% slower                | Tail latency / anomaly detection        |
| **Average**      | Mean of all requests                  | Not reliable for performance guarantees |

