| `max.poll.records`   | 1000–5000         | More messages per poll |
| `fetch.min.bytes`    | 50 KB–1 MB        | Fewer fetch requests   |
| `fetch.max.wait.ms`  | 10–50ms           | Better batching        |
| `enable.auto.commit` | false             | Control commit timing  |
| `commitAsync()`      | every few seconds | Lower overhead         |
| Consumer count       | = partitions      | Maximize parallelism   |

