| ----- | ------------------ | ------------------------- |
| `0`   | No ack from broker | Fastest, unsafe           |
| `1`   | Leader only        | **Fast & fairly safe** ✅  |
| `all` | All replicas       | Safest, highest latency ❌ |

For lower latency:
acks=1

✅ (F) Minimize Retries / Backoff

Each retry adds delay before message is resent.
For low-latency use cases:
retries=0
retry.backoff.ms=50

