| Infra    | Co-locate producer/consumer/broker | ✅ Yes                          |

⚡ 6️⃣ Trade-off: Throughput vs Latency

| Goal                  | Setting                                    | Outcome                |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------- |
| **Higher Throughput** | Larger batches, linger > 10ms, compression | Slower, more efficient |
| **Lower Latency**     | Smaller batches, linger = 0, fewer retries | Faster, less efficient |

✅ Example Real-World Use Cases
| Use Case                             | Priority                  | Typical Setting                             |
| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| Fraud detection / real-time alerting | Low latency               | `linger.ms=0`, `fetch.min.bytes=1`          |
| Log aggregation / analytics          | High throughput           | `linger.ms=20`, `batch.size=64KB`           |
| Financial transaction system         | Low latency + reliability | `acks=all`, `linger.ms=0`, fast compression |




